  "details": "VRChat Version: 2021.4.2p2 Build 1160\nDescription of the bug: The AFK parameter turns false for a moment right after the SteamVR menu is open, which should be constantly true I think? \nI use Valve Index, SteamVR 1.20.4, and OVR Advanced Settings (not sure if it's related tho).\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Enable AFK Detection if not.\n2. Open Debug. (not one of the causes, just to see what happens.)\n3. Push the system button to open the SteamVR menu\n4. The AFK parameter turns true, then false, and then true quickly.",
